KAMUI SB+rl-aq
"Store buffering with sw.rl and lw.aq. On Kamui these are PTX release and acquire at system scope (K2), which do not order a store before a later load (RISC-V's RCsc annotations would): allowed."
{
x=0;
y=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,gpu 0 ;
 sw.rl x, 1     | sw.rl y, 1     ;
 lw.aq r0, y    | lw.aq r1, x    ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
